	(text "CL = (CLcrystal - Cstray)*2\n   = (18 - 10)*2\n   = 16 pF\n\ngmcrit = 4*ESR*(2*pi*F)^2 *(C0 + CL)^2\n	   = 4*50*(2*pi*16 MHz)^2 * (3 pF + 16 pF)^2\n	   = 0.729 mA/V\ngain margin = gm/gmcrit = 5 mA/V / 0.729 mA/V = 6.86\n\nThe gain margin is sufficient to start the oscillation\nand the gainmargin > 5 condition is met. \n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 626.618 209.296 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "8815b09b-c5c0-4b02-8a26-215f035cd96a")
	)
